\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Consider a  backup generator 
