\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Store computer systems in a safe, restricted area 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Run virus checks on PC\rquote s and firewall connections 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Route cables to avoid single points of failure 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Change locks and passwords when employees leave the company 

\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Negotiate maintenance contracts that guarantee quick response and replacement 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Use surge suppressors and uninterruptible power supplies (UPSs)

\par }\pard \qj \li360\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Preliminary cleanup, such as packaging water-damaged fi
les and books in reinforced boxes, can lessen damage and business interruption following a disaster. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Assess personnel strengths and weaknesses in terms of knowledge, skill, and performance in order to compensate accordingly with skeleton crews. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Have all employees compose thorough job descriptions and procedures manuals specific to their responsibilities. Then, test to see if substitute personnel, guided solely by the documentation provided, can fulfill duties. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Arrange to consult with employee
s in their absence, ideally with them being accessible to answer questions at any time. Prepare a communications plan to facilitate emergency contacts. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
For certain circumstances, arrange for transportation -- either company-supplied or contracted from an outside service -- to shuttle employees to and from work. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
For efficient decision-making and prompt response with disaster declarations, maintain a clear-cut, functional description of what constitutes a disaster for your business. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Determine what
 the impact of declaring or not declaring a disaster would be on your company. This could include loss of revenue, negative publicity, or even loss of one's business. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
During a recovery operation, watch for signs of excessive stress and fatigue. Even exceptionally good performers reach a point where they no longer can think clearly and are prone to serious error. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Identify "at risk" employees -- those who are deeply affected by traumatic stress. Move them to a safe environment under the care of counselors or friends, and assess the need for professional intervention. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Prioritize your company's business applications. Determine which ones the billing agency simply cannot be without, and which can withstand some downtime without causing lasting damage. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Determine who will be involved in a disaster declaration process. Based on the needs of your company, decide whether a committee approach or individual should be designated to make the final call. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Be cognizant of how much time your company has to 
make a disaster declaration decision. Premature or late declarations both can have negative effects on one's business. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
To prevent equipment and furniture toppling, move heavier items to lower storage shelves; brace racks; secure cabinets and light fixtures, tall furniture, and desktop equipment including computers. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Cross-train employees in critical business processes so all personnel can perform multiple job functions when called upon to do so. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Institute employee assistance programs (EAPs) and i
mplement succession planning for all levels of personnel. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Inventory critical supplies and establish vendor and mutual aid agreements for post-disaster operations. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Delineate primary and alternate evacuation routes, and establish a safe personnel assembly area. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Identify piping vulnerable to snapping; provide a clearance allowance around these pipes using flexible couplings or flexible piping. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 When names, phone
 numbers, equipment, roles, and locations change at your company, make sure plans are updated at that time, and not put off until a scheduled plan review. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Conduct background checks of all employees and periodic checks of anyone with access to sensitive information. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
All employees should be educated on the effects of traumatic stress and in ways to help oneself and others who have been impacted by a crisis. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
When selecting cellular phones, consider features that may be useful during a crisis: emergency call, dual/multiple number assignment module, and memory and speed dialing. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
As part of your communications survival strategy, preplan to have local and 800 calls transferred to another number, a blank group of trunks, or to cellular phones after a disaster strikes. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
For businesses located in two-story buildings or higher, evacuation and search and rescue kits are essential -- to include stretchers, light sticks, goggles, etc. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Ensure that everyone \endash 
 from the owner to the temp answering the phones \endash  knows what's expected of them during a disaster. Secure in that knowledge, people are less likely to panic. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Training is key to effective personnel response. Employees are apt to carry out assigned duties correctly if they've had time to review, question, and internalize. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Stock appropriate emergency supplies, and ensure that all employees know where to find and how to use them. Identify personnel with first aid, CPR, or other medical/emergency response training. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Be sure that your alternate
 site is not served by the same electrical power grid or communications center as your primary facility. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 When purchasing em
ergency supplies, don't buy too much or not enough. Plan on serving the needs of 20 to 30 percent of your workforce for 72 hours. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Paper files take up space and can be a fire hazard if stored improperly; throw out piles of paper that are gathering dust to reduce risk. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Before fighting a fire in the workplace, be sure that the fire is small enough to be extinguished with a portable extinguisher. Do not attempt to fight a fire that is large or spreading rapidly. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Do not pinch electrical cords under or behind furniture; doing so runs the risk of fire. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Maintain current, accurate status information on personnel, facilities, and resources. In the event of an emergency, you will need these items close at hand. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Identify facilities in your area that could use hazardous materials. Determine whether an incident could affect your facility. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
Do not overestimate the security features of protective products, such as fireproof safes, window film, and firewalls; doing so could leave you under protected. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
If your company allows smoking, limit it to designated areas. Supply large tip-proof ashtrays and make sure everything in them is cold before emptied. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 Leave space for air to circulate around heaters and other hea
t-generating equipment such as copy machines and computer terminals. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
If your computer is making an unusual noise, turn it off. There is a good chance it has suffered or will suffer a head crash. The faster it is deactivated, the better the chance for data recovery. 
\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f14\fs16 \loch\af14\dbch\af0\hich\f14 \'71\tab}}\pard \qj \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f1\fs24 
In the aftermath of a disaster, provide press releases detailing the "when, where, how, and why" of an incident; keep records of all information released. 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1 
\par }}